      Resolved &lt;time title=&quot;27 May 2026 at 16:10&quot; datetime=&quot;2026-05-27T16:10:29Z&quot;&gt;about 11 hours ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/qstep&quot;&gt;qstep&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;note-comment-text&quot;&gt;https://www.openstreetmap.org/changeset/183264267

